      "claim": "The biparietal (minimum) diameter of an average adult human skull is about 140 mm.",
      "evidence": "Anthropometric surveys of adult cranial dimensions (e.g., White & Folkens, 2005; WHO growth standards).",
      "weight": 0.30,
      "depends_on": []
    },
